{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Looking for a Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Missing Ad"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le03ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be a shoo-in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who is certain to succeed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She said I was a shoo-in for the job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about a job posting."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be posted"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to publish something so that everyone \u200bknows what is \u200bhappening"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The job that she talked about is no longer posted on the company website."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "headhunter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person whose job is to find employees for available positions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Why don't you contact a headhunter in the field?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "allow me to introduce myself"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used in a letter to introduce yourself to someone you don't know"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Adam Bari. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "employment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " job; position"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I look forward to talking to you further about employment opportunities in communications."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to benefit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to profit; to take advantage of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Perhaps I could benefit from your services."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect with Comment Verbs or Phrases"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> with verbs like <span class=\"underline\">reckon</span>, <span class=\"underline\">imagine</span> and <span class=\"underline\">suppose</span> when you want to comment or report on what has been done."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span>, you refer to things that happened in the past but have a connection to the present.  This is useful when you talk about how things affect you and your current situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:  </br></br><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">reckon</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have met</span> many people like me. </br></br> I <span class=\"strong\">imagine</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have seen </span>from my r\u00e9sum\u00e9 that I worked as a copy editor and proofreader at a campus newspaper, where I also sold advertising space.   </br></br>I <span class=\"strong\">suppose</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have established</span> a portfolio of your written work. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The past participle of the main verb must be used in the Present Perfect tense.</br></br>  Look at the chart for the past participles of some verbs:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Past Participle</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you have been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"establish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"established\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you have established\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"helped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you have helped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"see\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"seen\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you have seen from my r\u00e9sum\u00e9 ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">reckon</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have helped</span> many people like me in the past."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">suppose</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have thought</span> of ways of promoting a candidate's written work. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals to Express True and Untrue in the Present Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Modals are helping verbs. They add meaning to the main verbs of a sentence. They help  convey the speaker's intentions, feelings and attitudes towards a topic."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Common modals you hear in business settings are:  </br></br>could </br> might</br>  may"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Perhaps<span class=\"strong\"> I could benefit</span> from your services.   </span></br></br>You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to express possibility in both the past and present.  </br></br>For example:  </br></br>I <span class=\"strong\">could help you</span> build your network of contacts and give you strategies for building your online presence. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the modal<span class=\"italic\"> would</span> to create conditional verb forms. It also serves as the past form of the modal verb \"will.\" </br></br> For example:</br></br><span class=\"italic\">  I<span class=\"strong\"> would be</span> very interested in working in the area of communications. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use<span class=\"italic\"> might</span> and <span class=\"italic\">may </span>to express certainty about past and present actions or events. </br></br> For example: </br></br> <span class=\"italic\">He <span class=\"strong\">may be able to tell</span> you who is hiring and which companies are the best ones to work for.  </br><span class=\"italic\"></br>My friend Kristi just got a job as an editorial assistant at BFP, and she said there <span class=\"strong\">might be</span> another position available."}, {"type": "example", "content": " You <span class=\"strong\"> could</span> assist me with my job search. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\"> would</span> have  established a substantial portfolio."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They <span class=\"strong\">might/may</span> be able to find some employment opportunities for you."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Start with the date and opening salutation of a letter."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Introduce yourself."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain what kind of a job you are looking for."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain what you have done in the past that would help you get the job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask questions about how the headhunter can help you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Conclude the letter with a final closing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a total of 100 - 120 words. Make sure you use correct spelling and punctuation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your letter aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a letter following the correct structure (date, salutation, closing)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about my past work experiences. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask appropriate questions."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  My friend Kristi just got a job as an editorial assistant at BFP, and she said there might be another position available. She said I was a shoo-in, but the job that she talked about is no longer posted on the company website.\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: Oh, that's too bad. Maybe they will upload another position. Why don't you contact a headhunter in the field? I know someone. His name is Andrew Goldstein. He may be able tell you who is hiring and which companies are the best ones to work for.\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  OK, he might be able to help me.  I'll write to him now.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<Br/>Dear Mr. Goldstein,\n<Br/><Br/>Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Adam Bari.  Ms. Hayley Sanders, who is my friend, suggested that I write to you.  Perhaps I could benefit from your services. I reckon you have helped many people like me in the past.\n<Br/><Br/>I would be very interested in working in the area of communications. I am a recent graduate in the field. I imagine you have seen from my r\u00e9sum\u00e9  that I worked as a copy editor and a proofreader at a campus newspaper, where I also sold advertising space. I am very interested in positions such as web content editor, editorial assistant or copy editor.", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn10le03ob01re2img06.jpg "}, {"text": "I take great pride in my writing style.  I suppose you have thought of ways of promoting a candidate's written work. I have established a substantial portfolio of written work that you may be interested in viewing.\nI look forward to talking to you further about employment opportunities in communications, and how you could assist me with my job search.\n<Br/><Br/>Sincerely,\n<Br/><Br/>Adam Bari", "id": 3, "time": "68000", "image": "engenn10le03ob01re2img07.jpg "}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can request or report facts about events or actions related to work and jobs. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express true, untrue, and possible events in present and in past."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can give a supported argument about a work-related process.  "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Who helps you when you look for a new job?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How can another person, like a headhunter, help you find a job?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "I so want this job!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Adam sends his <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">r\u00e9sum\u00e9 </span> to Mr. Goldstein, a headhunter."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio."}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"tip_id": 0, "type": "text", "content": "The word <span class=\"italic\">\"r\u00e9sum\u00e9 \"</span> can also be written as \u201cresume\u201d.  You can also say \u201cC.V.\u201d"}]}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the sentences that include a relative clause."}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "She said I was a shoo-in, but the job that she talked about is no longer posted on the company website. "}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "text": "", "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "My friend Kristi just got a job as an editorial assistant at BFP, and she said there might be another position available."}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "text": "", "id": 2, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "I would be very interested in working in the area of communications."}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": true, "text": "", "id": 3, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ms Hayley Sanders, who is my friend, suggested that I write to you."}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "text": "", "id": 4, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "She said I was a shoo-in for the job."}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": true, "text": "", "id": 5, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "I imagine you have seen from my r\u00e9sum\u00e9 that I worked as a copy editor and proofreader at a campus newspaper, where I also sold advertising space."}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": true, "text": "", "id": 6, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "The job that she talked about is no longer posted on the company website."}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "text": "", "id": 7, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why don't you contact a headhunter in the field?"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": true, "text": "", "id": 8, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "I have established a substantial portfolio of written work that you may be interested in viewing."}], "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 2, "type": "MMM", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Hayley talks to Adam about a job opportunity. "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 1"}]}, {"type": "fe